    kuna `dirtypool`, `latecse`, `implweight` (all default off).  dirtypool
    lets a repeated rule-pool sweep visit only the ops near the previous
    sweep's rewrites (a speed option: lua -O0 decompiles 2.5x faster);
    latecse merges identical pure ops reading one varnode once the rules
    settle; implweight N lets an expression read by more than two ops print
    inline while its terms times its readers is at most N.

